+    /// hermes-web dashboard requires in one machine: routed egress (the agent's LLM/hub calls) + an
+    /// OPFS-paged κ-disk (durable `hermes_state.py` SQLite/FTS5) + loopback ingress (the dashboard
+    /// reaching the in-guest `web_server.py`). The RISC-V analogue of the AArch64
